ct 6; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in a direct message with marcus-lindqvist on 2026-10-14 11:00: Got it, Marcus. I've noted that Elodie Ashdown at Tamsin Cold Chain is now your go-to for escalations on the Ironbridge rollout. I'll keep it to our DMs and won't share it anywhere else.\n```","id":6,"source":"assistant, a direct message with marcus-lindqvist, 2026-10-14T11:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 4; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nMarcus Lindqvist (marcus-lindqvist, Account manager, North team) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-14 11:00: For future reference, no action needed: my go-to person at Tamsin Cold Chain for escalations on the Ironbridge rollout is Elodie Ashdown from now on. Please remember that for me.\n```","id":4,"source":"marcus-lindqvist, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-14T11:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"marcus-lindqvist"}
